: "$graphify-root$_planner_phases_4bc07824_9a31_4616_9aa8_abd4e66a105a_dependencies", "label": "dependencies", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L18"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_planner_phases_4bc07824_9a31_4616_9aa8_abd4e66a105a_dependson", "label": "dependsOn", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L19"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_planner_phases_4bc07824_9a31_4616_9aa8_abd4e66a105a_risks", "label": "risks", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L20"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_planner_phases_4bc07824_9a31_4616_9aa8_abd4e66a105a_openquestions", "label": "openQuestions", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L21"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_planner_phases_4bc07824_9a31_4616_9aa8_abd4e66a105a_decisions", "label": "decisions", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_the_scene_seam_is_a_enqueue_scene_collects_placements_id_rect_clip_and_the_host_blits_them_in_its_own_pass_single_responsibility_the_showcase_needs_no_gpu_pass_and_wgpu_types_stay_out_of_the_crate_boundary_rule_zero", "label": "The scene seam is (a): enqueue_scene collects placements {id, rect, clip} and the host blits them in its own pass \u2014 single responsibility, the showcase needs no GPU pass, and wgpu types stay out of the crate boundary (Rule Zero).", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_the_seam_is_generic_a_component_hosting_content_something_else_rasterises_so_image_surfaces_video_panes_and_a_plugin_s_canvas_get_it_for_free_not_a_terminal_feature", "label": "The seam is generic \u2014 'a component hosting content something else rasterises' \u2014 so image surfaces, video panes and a plugin's canvas get it for free. Not a terminal feature.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_the_terminal_splits_along_the_widget_component_line_the_surface_hosting_widget_in_heca_grid_ui_terminal_itself_in_heca_src_components_terminal_mod_rs_the_only_file_touching_appstate", "label": "The terminal splits along the widget/component line: the surface-hosting widget in heca-grid-ui, Terminal itself in heca/src/components/terminal/ (mod.rs the only file touching AppState).", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_p097_f003_is_a_prerequisite_of_this_phase_not_an_overlap_p097_owns_the_dispatch_p094_owns_the_terminal", "label": "P097(F003) is a prerequisite of this phase, not an overlap. P097 owns the dispatch, P094 owns the terminal.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_the_previous_handoff_s_parked_on_antonio_s_instruction_was_my_own_note_quoted_back_as_his_decision_disregarded", "label": "The previous handoff's 'PARKED on Antonio's instruction' was my own note quoted back as his decision. Disregarded.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_the_scene_seam_is_a_widget_records_a_request_the_host_performs_the_gpu_work_rejected_giving_the_drawing_pass_an_encoder_and_target_it_would_give_a_function_that_describes_what_to_draw_a_second_job_owning_pass_lifetime_and_force_every_caller_to_supply_one_including_the_showcase_which_has_no_gpu_pass_of_its_own", "label": "The scene seam is: a widget records a request, the host performs the GPU work. Rejected giving the drawing pass an encoder and target \u2014 it would give a function that describes what to draw a second job (owning pass lifetime) and force every caller to supply one, including the showcase, which has no GPU pass of its own.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_the_seam_is_generic_a_component_hosting_content_something_else_rasterises_and_serves_two_unrelated_features_the_terminal_s_texture_and_the_frost_s_blur_two_features_needing_one_seam_is_why_it_is_the_right_shape_rather_than_a_convenience", "label": "The seam is GENERIC \u2014 'a component hosting content something else rasterises' \u2014 and serves two unrelated features: the terminal's texture and the frost's blur. Two features needing one seam is why it is the right shape rather than a convenience.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_collecting_the_requests_is_a_pure_read_of_the_scene_so_it_is_host_requests_scene_and_not_part_of_enqueue_scene_discovered_by_trying_the_other_way_it_forced_a_signature_change_on_every_caller_for_something_none_of_them_wanted_and_made_the_collection_untestable_because_no_test_can_build_a_renderer_without_a_gpu", "label": "Collecting the requests is a PURE READ of the scene, so it is host_requests(scene) and not part of enqueue_scene. Discovered by trying the other way: it forced a signature change on every caller for something none of them wanted, and made the collection untestable because no test can build a renderer without a GPU.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_the_frost_makes_the_seam_a_prerequisite_of_moving_layers_into_one_tree_not_a_parallel_task_the_blur_needs_a_moment_where_the_scene_holds_everything_beneath_a_surface_and_nothing_of_it_that_moment_exists_today_only_because_chrome_and_layers_paint_into_two_separate_scenes_and_disappears_the_instant_they_share_one", "label": "The frost makes the seam a PREREQUISITE of moving layers into one tree, not a parallel task. The blur needs a moment where the scene holds everything beneath a surface and nothing of it; that moment exists today only because chrome and layers paint into two separate scenes, and disappears the instant they share one.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_the_terminal_splits_along_the_widget_component_line_the_surface_hosting_widget_in_heca_grid_ui_terminal_itself_in_heca_src_components_terminal", "label": "The terminal splits along the widget/component line: the surface-hosting widget in heca-grid-ui, Terminal itself in heca/src/components/terminal/.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_t448_s_terminal_half_was_relocated_to_t449_by_agreement_with_antonio_2026_08_31_there_is_no_pane_content_widget_tree_to_emit_cx_surface_from_until_the_terminal_component_exists_and_bolting_it_onto_the_current_direct_paint_path_paint_terminal_pane_shell_blit_retained_terminal_layer_would_be_a_throwaway_t449_removes_hostdraw_surface_requests_are_a_documented_no_op_in_the_render_rs_host_loop_until_then", "label": "T448's terminal half was RELOCATED to T449 by agreement with Antonio (2026-08-31). There is no pane-content widget tree to emit cx.surface from until the Terminal component exists, and bolting it onto the current direct-paint path (paint_terminal_pane_shell / blit_retained_terminal_layer) would be a throwaway T449 removes. HostDraw::Surface requests are a documented no-op in the render.rs host loop until then.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_the_frost_half_of_the_seam_landed_as_overlay_frosted_true_a_surface_property_not_a_host_pass_recorded_in_the_scene_s_base_band_and_performed_by_the_host_between_the_base_flush_and_the_overlay_band_that_is_what_stopped_the_frost_breaking_when_p097_t494_collapsed_chrome_and_layers_into_one_scene", "label": "The frost half of the seam landed as Overlay::frosted(true) \u2014 a surface property, not a host pass \u2014 recorded in the scene's BASE band and performed by the host between the base flush and the overlay band. That is what stopped the frost breaking when P097/T494 collapsed chrome and layers into one scene.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "ref_the_seam_is_generic_and_serves_two_unrelated_features_the_terminal_s_texture_the_frost_s_blur_which_is_why_it_is_the_right_shape_rather_than_a_convenience", "label": "The seam is generic and serves two unrelated features (the terminal's texture, the frost's blur), which is why it is the right shape rather than a convenience.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L22"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_planner_phases_4bc07824_9a31_4616_9aa8_abd4e66a105a_accepteddecisions", "label": "acceptedDecisions", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L37"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_planner_phases_4bc07824_9a31_4616_9aa8_abd4e66a105a_completioncriteria", "label": "completionCriteria", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L38"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_planner_phases_4bc07824_9a31_4616_9aa8_abd4e66a105a_taskids", "label": "taskIds", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".planner/phases/4bc07824-9a31-4616-9aa8-abd4e66a105a.json", "source_location": "L39"}, {"id": "ref_03754626_e33b_4c53_8f7e_aaff41cc4b65", "label": "03754626-e33b-4c53-8